Usage: bash powerup.sh [--gui | --cli] [OPTIONS] [os-update | CATEGORY ... | all]

On Ubuntu 24.04 (Noble), upgrade to Ubuntu 26.04 LTS using do-release-upgrade.
After any required reboot, rerun the same command to finish Resolute/Tor setup.
